                        "entry_id": "5ee62b9d-f8df-3ad8-a758-c00606186fe2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Allah (God, in Islam)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d309875-937b-4aae-a222-686cc20b5760",
                                "sense_id": "4c952dc2-657e-3dde-b1b1-f1b304784f2f",
                                "text": "да прости́т Алла́х его́ грехи́",
                                "translation": "may Allah forgive his sins",
                                "english": "may Allah forgive his sins"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a68c14e2-4b0d-41f3-9599-6cd7e631faa0",
                                "sense_id": "4c952dc2-657e-3dde-b1b1-f1b304784f2f",
                                "text": "Алла́х ве́дает, из каки́х рук взял тогда́ Богда́нов е́вою ееылку.",
                                "translation": "Allah alone knows from what source Bogdanov took this reference.",
                                "english": "Allah alone knows from what source Bogdanov took this reference."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0163e947-1ee8-4d90-92ba-36a3508fd9b0",
                                "sense_id": "4c952dc2-657e-3dde-b1b1-f1b304784f2f",
                                "text": "Мои́м благослове́нным дея́ниям возра́довался алла́х^([sic]) и благослови́л меня́, Гассана Абдуррахмана, джи́нна, чтущего его́.",
                                "translation": "Allah was overjoyed at my blessed doings and blessed me, Hassan Abdurrakhman, a Genie who worshipped him.",
                                "english": "Allah was overjoyed at my blessed doings and blessed me, Hassan Abdurrakhman, a Genie who worshipped him."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
